Identify the actual reason the account-creation portal is not appearing.

Possible causes may include an incorrect initial route, a stale authenticated-state variable, asynchronous initialization racing against routing, a default-user fallback, an unconditional home redirect, or an authentication screen that is never selected.

These are investigation possibilities, not assumptions. Verify the cause in the actual code.

Correct the source of the problem rather than adding another overlay or duplicate registration screen.

**Do not declare this task complete until a clean first-launch test proves that the account-creation portal appears immediately after the existing animation and transition.**

