Verify:
- Input-coordinate validation.
- Valid search-radius limits.
- Service-category filtering.
- Worker availability checks.
- Verification eligibility where required.
- Location freshness checks.
- Spatial-index usage.
- Reasonable result limits.
- Correct distance calculations.
