Avoid storing or logging more location information than the application actually needs.

Do not display fake locations, distances, or arrival times when live information is unavailable.

## 4.4 Real-time communication

Test the existing WebSocket/Socket.IO and Redis-based features.

Verify:
- Authentication when connecting.
- Authorization when joining job rooms.
- Access restrictions for private channels.
- Message ownership.
- Event payload validation.
- Duplicate event handling.
- Reconnection behavior.
