## 4.5 SOS and emergency handling

Verify the complete SOS flow.

The frontend must preserve its existing explicit emergency-confirmation interaction, including the intended countdown.

The backend must validate the caller and relevant job permissions, prevent unintended duplicate alerts, persist the event, initiate only the configured notification mechanism, and track the actual delivery result.

